        <object label="&lt;span style=&quot;text-wrap-mode: nowrap; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;&amp;lt;&amp;lt;interface&amp;gt;&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br style=&quot;text-wrap-mode: nowrap; padding: 0px; margin: 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;InitializingBean&lt;br&gt;【生命周期管理】&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" 作用="Spring 容器实例化 Bean 时的初始化钩子 (afterPropertiesSet()) 和销毁钩子 (destroy())。" 设计思想="为什么连接工厂需要它们？ 像 Redis 连接池、Netty 的 EventLoopGroup 等都是重量级资源。&#xa;&#xa;当 Spring 启动，属性注入完成后，会调用 afterPropertiesSet()（来自 InitializingBean）。工厂会在这个时候去初始化连接池、预热连接、或者启动 Netty 客户端线程。" id="Rnn9wGYFX2iCv91cSKAG-498">
          <mxCell collapsed="1" parent="WIyWlLk6GJQsqaUBKTNV-1" style="swimlane;fontStyle=1;align=center;verticalAlign=top;childLayout=stackLayout;horizontal=1;startSize=54;horizontalStack=0;resizeParent=1;resizeParentMax=0;resizeLast=0;collapsible=1;marginBottom=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;rounded=1;strokeColor=#A1C2EC;strokeWidth=1;spacing=6;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=13;fontColor=#37352F;fillColor=#EBF3FC;" vertex="1">
            <mxGeometry height="70" width="110" x="1415" y="4370" as="geometry">
              <mxRectangle height="103" width="201" x="340" y="3966" as="alternateBounds" />
            </mxGeometry>
          </mxCell>
        </object>
        <mxCell id="Rnn9wGYFX2iCv91cSKAG-499" parent="Rnn9wGYFX2iCv91cSKAG-498" style="line;strokeWidth=1;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingTop=-1;spacingLeft=3;spacingRight=3;rotatable=0;labelPosition=right;points=[];portConstraint=eastwest;strokeColor=inherit;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="8" width="201" y="48" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="Rnn9wGYFX2iCv91cSKAG-500" parent="Rnn9wGYFX2iCv91cSKAG-498" style="text;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;overflow=hidden;rotatable=0;points=[[0,0.5],[1,0.5]];portConstraint=eastwest;" value="+destroy() : void" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="47" width="201" y="56" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <object label="&lt;span style=&quot;text-wrap-mode: nowrap; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;&amp;lt;&amp;lt;interface&amp;gt;&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br style=&quot;text-wrap-mode: nowrap; padding: 0px; margin: 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;DisposableBean&lt;br&gt;【生命周期管理】&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" 作用="当应用关闭时，Spring 会调用 destroy()（来自 DisposableBean）。工厂在这里执行优雅停机，释放 TCP 连接，销毁连接池，防止资源泄漏。" id="Rnn9wGYFX2iCv91cSKAG-501">
          <mxCell collapsed="1" parent="WIyWlLk6GJQsqaUBKTNV-1" style="swimlane;fontStyle=1;align=center;verticalAlign=top;childLayout=stackLayout;horizontal=1;startSize=58;horizontalStack=0;resizeParent=1;resizeParentMax=0;resizeLast=0;collapsible=1;marginBottom=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;rounded=1;strokeColor=#A1C2EC;strokeWidth=1;spacing=6;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=13;fontColor=#37352F;fillColor=#EBF3FC;" vertex="1">
            <mxGeometry height="70" width="120" x="1410" y="4490" as="geometry">
              <mxRectangle height="103" width="279" x="161" y="4005" as="alternateBounds" />
            </mxGeometry>
